OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry
OL,6,Finitially this evening, but cloud and
OL,7,Foutbreaks of rain will spread
OL,8,Fsoutheastwards, perhaps turning heavy
OL,9,Fin places over Cumbria. Drier and
OL,10,Fclearer from the north towards dawn.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FLargely dry and bright with
OL,13,Fspells of sunshine for much of the
OL,14,Fday. Turning cloudier later with rain
OL,15,Fand stronger winds moving by the
OL,16,Fevening. Temperatures near average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
