OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FSunshine and blustery showers on
OL,7,FTuesday, although showers easing
OL,8,Flater. Mostly fine and dry Wednesday,
OL,9,Fbefore some patchy rain arrives
OL,10,Fthroughout Thursday. Feeling rather
OL,11,Fcool for the time of year.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
